 DJ, Rhind DW</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Interactive techniques and exploratory spatial data analysis</article-title><source>Geographical Information Systems: Principles, Techniques, Management and Applications</source><year>1999</year><publisher-name>New York , John Wiley</publisher-name><fpage>251</fpage><lpage>264</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Advocacy for youths</collab></person-group><article-title>Adolescent Reproductive Health in Nigeria: The facts</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.advocatesforyouth.org/PUBLICATIONS/factsheet/fsnigeria.htm"/></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Nigeria: DHS, 2003 - Final Report</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.measuredhs.com/pubs/pdf/FR148/00FrontMatter.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>StataCorp</collab></person-group><source>Stata Statistical Software: Release 10</source><year>2007</year><publisher-name>College Station, TX , StataCorp LP</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Snijders</surname><given-names>TAB</given-names></name><name><surname>Bosker</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><source>Multilevel analysis - an introduction to basic and advanced multilevel modeling</source><year>1999</year><publisher-name>Thousand Oaks, California , SAGE Publications</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rasbash</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Steele</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Browne</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Prosser</surname><given-name